            "review_title": "Review at Crystal Jade",
            "review_text": "Lisa L\n3 contributions\n0\nWorst meal in memory\nMay 2023 • Family\nWe chose this restaurant because it was in our hotel and we were tired after a long flight. They seated us first in a cold out of the way annexe until we asked to be moved to the main dining area. We ordered and it took about 40 minutes for any food or drink to arrive. When it did the food was so awful that we couldn’t eat it despite being quite hungry. We paid the (large) bill and left. Avoid\nRead more\nWritten May 21, 2023",
